@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `uic-autojoy-nouns`
IMPORT `uic-autojoy-p1-general`
IMPORT `uic-autojoy-p2-accident`
IMPORT `uic-autojoy-p3-liability`
IMPORT `uic-autojoy-test-fixtures`

-- Tests for Part 2 (accident to the persons carried) and Part 3 (liability). The standard
-- policy's Part 2 cover is 100.000.000 a person for 5 persons. The payout-table percentages
-- are scenario values: the table (Decision 05/TC-BH of 1993) is not in the source.
-- Expected values were worked by hand from the source; the arithmetic is beside them.

§ `Tests — Part 2 and Part 3`

§§ `Accidents`

-- The master builder.
GIVEN d   IS A DATE
      r   IS A `A role on the vehicle`
      ov  IS A BOOLEAN
      it  IS A BOOLEAN
      iv  IS A BOOLEAN
      ag  IS A BOOLEAN
      cs  IS A LIST OF `A circumstance of the accident`
      al  IS A BOOLEAN
      lic IS A `A driving licence status`
      o   IS AN `An outcome of the accident`
      pc  IS A NUMBER
      ms  IS A BOOLEAN
      hp  IS A NUMBER
      med IS A NUMBER
      nut IS A NUMBER
      hd  IS A NUMBER
      wd  IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      pd  IS A NUMBER
      wt  IS A BOOLEAN
      np  IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `An accident to a person carried`
`the accident on` d `to` r `, on the vehicle` ov `, in traffic` it `, in Vietnam` iv `, agreed abroad` ag `, circumstances` cs `, alcohol` al `, licence` lic `, outcome` o `, table` pc `, made worse` ms `, healthy table` hp `, medical` med `, nutrition` nut `, hospital days` hd `, days off work` wd `, paid` pd `, death in term` wt `, persons on board` np MEANS
    `An accident to a person carried` WITH
        `date of the accident`                                               IS d
        `time of the accident`                                               IS `the time` 10 `h` 0
        `in Vietnam`                                                         IS iv
        `outside Vietnam under another agreement`                            IS ag
        `role`                                                               IS r
        `on the vehicle or getting on or off`                                IS ov
        `while the vehicle was in traffic`                                   IS it
        `circumstances`                                                      IS cs
        `alcohol in blood or breath`                                         IS al
        `using narcotics or banned stimulants`                               IS FALSE
        `licence`                                                            IS lic
        `outcome`                                                            IS o
        `percentage in the payout table`                                     IS pc
        `made worse by an existing illness or disability, or by late or improper treatment`  IS ms
        `percentage for the same injury in a healthy person properly treated` IS hp
        `actual medical costs`                                               IS med
        `nutrition costs claimed`                                            IS nut
        `days in hospital and after discharge as the doctor prescribed`      IS hd
        `days off work confirmed by the workplace`                           IS wd
        `amounts already paid for this accident`                             IS pd
        `death within the contract term`                                     IS wt
        `persons actually on the vehicle`                                    IS np
        `claim made on`                                                      IS d PLUS 10
        `days of force majeure or other objective obstacle`                  IS 0

-- A passenger hurt on 10 June 2026 on the vehicle in traffic in Vietnam, three on board;
-- medical costs 3.000.000, nutrition 2.000.000, 30 days of treatment, 20 days off work.
GIVEN o  IS AN `An outcome of the accident`
      pc IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `An accident to a person carried`
`a passenger's accident, with the outcome` o `at the table percentage` pc MEANS
    `the accident on` (YMD 2026 6 10) `to` `another person carried` `, on the vehicle` TRUE `, in traffic` TRUE `, in Vietnam` TRUE `, agreed abroad` FALSE `, circumstances` EMPTY `, alcohol` FALSE `, licence` `a valid licence for this kind of vehicle` `, outcome` o `, table` pc `, made worse` FALSE `, healthy table` pc `, medical` 3_000_000 `, nutrition` 2_000_000 `, hospital days` 30 `, days off work` (JUST 20) `, paid` 0 `, death in term` TRUE `, persons on board` 3

GIVEN r   IS A `A role on the vehicle`
      cs  IS A LIST OF `A circumstance of the accident`
      al  IS A BOOLEAN
      lic IS A `A driving licence status`
GIVETH AN `An accident to a person carried`
`a permanent injury at 35% to` r `, circumstances` cs `, alcohol` al `, licence` lic MEANS
    `the accident on` (YMD 2026 6 10) `to` r `, on the vehicle` TRUE `, in traffic` TRUE `, in Vietnam` TRUE `, agreed abroad` FALSE `, circumstances` cs `, alcohol` al `, licence` lic `, outcome` `permanent injury` `, table` (35%) `, made worse` FALSE `, healthy table` (35%) `, medical` 0 `, nutrition` 0 `, hospital days` 0 `, days off work` (JUST 0) `, paid` 0 `, death in term` TRUE `, persons on board` 3

GIVEN acc IS AN `An accident to a person carried`
GIVETH A `The answer to a claim under Part 2`
`the Part 2 answer for` acc MEANS
    `Part 2 — the answer to` acc `under` `the standard policy`

§§ `Part 2 Article 2 — scope`

-- src:561 | Thiệt hại thân thể đối với người được bảo hiểm do tai nạn khi đang ở trên xe, lên xuống xe trong quá trình xe đang
-- src:562 | tham gia giao thông.
#ASSERT `the Part 2 answer for` (`a passenger's accident, with the outcome` `death` `at the table percentage` (100%)) EQUALS `payable under Part 2` 100_000_000
#ASSERT `the Part 2 answer for` (`the accident on` (YMD 2026 6 10) `to` `another person carried` `, on the vehicle` TRUE `, in traffic` FALSE `, in Vietnam` TRUE `, agreed abroad` FALSE `, circumstances` EMPTY `, alcohol` FALSE `, licence` `a valid licence for this kind of vehicle` `, outcome` `death` `, table` (100%) `, made worse` FALSE `, healthy table` (100%) `, medical` 0 `, nutrition` 0 `, hospital days` 0 `, days off work` (JUST 0) `, paid` 0 `, death in term` TRUE `, persons on board` 3) EQUALS `not covered under Part 2` (LIST `the person was not on the vehicle, or getting on or off, while it was in traffic`)
#ASSERT `the Part 2 answer for` (`the accident on` (YMD 2026 6 10) `to` `another person carried` `, on the vehicle` FALSE `, in traffic` TRUE `, in Vietnam` TRUE `, agreed abroad` FALSE `, circumstances` EMPTY `, alcohol` FALSE `, licence` `a valid licence for this kind of vehicle` `, outcome` `death` `, table` (100%) `, made worse` FALSE `, healthy table` (100%) `, medical` 0 `, nutrition` 0 `, hospital days` 0 `, days off work` (JUST 0) `, paid` 0 `, death in term` TRUE `, persons on board` 3) EQUALS `not covered under Part 2` (LIST `the person was not on the vehicle, or getting on or off, while it was in traffic`)
-- The general provisions of Part 1 apply: an accident on 1 January 2027 is outside the period.
#ASSERT `the Part 2 answer for` (`the accident on` (YMD 2027 1 1) `to` `another person carried` `, on the vehicle` TRUE `, in traffic` TRUE `, in Vietnam` TRUE `, agreed abroad` FALSE `, circumstances` EMPTY `, alcohol` FALSE `, licence` `a valid licence for this kind of vehicle` `, outcome` `death` `, table` (100%) `, made worse` FALSE `, healthy table` (100%) `, medical` 0 `, nutrition` 0 `, hospital days` 0 `, days off work` (JUST 0) `, paid` 0 `, death in term` TRUE `, persons on board` 3) EQUALS `not covered under Part 2` (LIST `the loss happened outside the insurance period`)
-- Part 2 not taken.
#ASSERT `Part 2 — the answer to` (`a passenger's accident, with the outcome` `death` `at the table percentage` (100%)) `under` `the standard policy without Part 2, with Part 3` EQUALS `not covered under Part 2` (LIST `no cover under Part 2 was taken`)

§§ `Part 2 Article 3 — exclusions, each with a near miss`

-- 3.1 outside Vietnam; "unless otherwise agreed" — the agreement's terms are not here.
-- src:566 | 1. Tổn thất, tai nạn xảy ra ngoài lãnh thổ nước CHXHCN Việt Nam (trừ khi có thỏa thuận khác);
#ASSERT `the Part 2 answer for` (`the accident on` (YMD 2026 6 10) `to` `another person carried` `, on the vehicle` TRUE `, in traffic` TRUE `, in Vietnam` FALSE `, agreed abroad` FALSE `, circumstances` EMPTY `, alcohol` FALSE `, licence` `a valid licence for this kind of vehicle` `, outcome` `death` `, table` (100%) `, made worse` FALSE `, healthy table` (100%) `, medical` 0 `, nutrition` 0 `, hospital days` 0 `, days off work` (JUST 0) `, paid` 0 `, death in term` TRUE `, persons on board` 3) EQUALS `not covered under Part 2` (LIST `excluded under Part 2 by` `P2 3.1 outside Vietnam`)
#ASSERT REFUSED `the Part 2 answer for` (`the accident on` (YMD 2026 6 10) `to` `another person carried` `, on the vehicle` TRUE `, in traffic` TRUE `, in Vietnam` FALSE `, agreed abroad` TRUE `, circumstances` EMPTY `, alcohol` FALSE `, licence` `a valid licence for this kind of vehicle` `, outcome` `death` `, table` (100%) `, made worse` FALSE `, healthy table` (100%) `, medical` 0 `, nutrition` 0 `, hospital days` 0 `, days off work` (JUST 0) `, paid` 0 `, death in term` TRUE `, persons on board` 3) BECAUSE "the terms of an agreement to cover an accident outside Vietnam are not in the document"

-- 3.2 war or terrorism; 3.3 a deliberate act of the insured person.
-- src:567 | 2. Tổn thất xảy ra trong những trường hợp: Chiến tranh, khủng bố;
-- src:570 | 3. Người được bảo hiểm có hành động cố ý gây thiệt hại;
#ASSERT `the Part 2 answer for` (`a permanent injury at 35% to` `another person carried` `, circumstances` (LIST `during war`) `, alcohol` FALSE `, licence` `a valid licence for this kind of vehicle`) EQUALS `not covered under Part 2` (LIST `excluded under Part 2 by` `P2 3.2 war or terrorism`)
#ASSERT `the Part 2 answer for` (`a permanent injury at 35% to` `another person carried` `, circumstances` (LIST `a deliberate act of the insured person to cause the harm`) `, alcohol` FALSE `, licence` `a valid licence for this kind of vehicle`) EQUALS `not covered under Part 2` (LIST `excluded under Part 2 by` `P2 3.3 a deliberate act of the insured person`)

-- 3.4 a fight, unless confirmed to be self-defence.
-- src:571 | 4. Người được bảo hiểm tham gia đánh nhau trừ khi được xác nhận đó là hành động tự vệ;
#ASSERT `the Part 2 answer for` (`a permanent injury at 35% to` `another person carried` `, circumstances` (LIST `the insured person taking part in a fight`) `, alcohol` FALSE `, licence` `a valid licence for this kind of vehicle`) EQUALS `not covered under Part 2` (LIST `excluded under Part 2 by` `P2 3.4 a fight, not in self-defence`)
#ASSERT `the Part 2 answer for` (`a permanent injury at 35% to` `another person carried` `, circumstances` (LIST `the insured person taking part in a fight`, `confirmed to be self-defence`) `, alcohol` FALSE `, licence` `a valid licence for this kind of vehicle`) EQUALS `payable under Part 2` 35_000_000

-- 3.5 alcohol, only where the insured person is the driver.
-- src:572 | 5. Người được bảo hiểm là người điều khiển xe trong tình trạng có nồng độ cồn trong máu hoặc khí thở, sử dụng
-- src:573 | ma túy và chất kích thích bị cấm theo quy định của pháp luật;
#ASSERT `the Part 2 answer for` (`a permanent injury at 35% to` `the driver` `, circumstances` EMPTY `, alcohol` TRUE `, licence` `a valid licence for this kind of vehicle`) EQUALS `not covered under Part 2` (LIST `excluded under Part 2 by` `P2 3.5 a driver with alcohol, narcotics or banned stimulants`)
#ASSERT `the Part 2 answer for` (`a permanent injury at 35% to` `another person carried` `, circumstances` EMPTY `, alcohol` TRUE `, licence` `a valid licence for this kind of vehicle`) EQUALS `payable under Part 2` 35_000_000

-- 3.6 no licence, or one not appropriate, only where the insured person is the driver. An
-- expired licence is not named (fork F32).
-- src:576 | 6. Người được bảo hiểm là người điều khiển xe không có Giấy phép lái xe hoặc Giấy phép lái xe không phù hợp đối
-- src:577 | với loại xe cơ giới bắt buộc phải có Giấy phép lái xe;
#ASSERT `the Part 2 answer for` (`a permanent injury at 35% to` `the driver` `, circumstances` EMPTY `, alcohol` FALSE `, licence` `no licence`) EQUALS `not covered under Part 2` (LIST `excluded under Part 2 by` `P2 3.6 a driver without an appropriate licence`)
#ASSERT `the Part 2 answer for` (`a permanent injury at 35% to` `the driver` `, circumstances` EMPTY `, alcohol` FALSE `, licence` `a licence not appropriate to this kind of vehicle`) EQUALS `not covered under Part 2` (LIST `excluded under Part 2 by` `P2 3.6 a driver without an appropriate licence`)
#ASSERT `the Part 2 answer for` (`a permanent injury at 35% to` `the driver` `, circumstances` EMPTY `, alcohol` FALSE `, licence` `an expired licence`) EQUALS `payable under Part 2` 35_000_000
#ASSERT `the Part 2 answer for` (`a permanent injury at 35% to` `another person carried` `, circumstances` EMPTY `, alcohol` FALSE `, licence` `no licence`) EQUALS `payable under Part 2` 35_000_000

-- 3.7 driving practice or racing; 3.8 unlawful goods or loading that caused the harm.
-- src:578 | 7. Xe sử dụng để tập lái, đua thể thao, đua xe (kể cả hợp pháp hay trái phép);
-- src:579 | 8. Xe chở hàng trái phép theo quy định của pháp luật hoặc không thực hiện các quy định về vận chuyển, xếp dỡ
-- src:580 | hàng hóa theo quy định của pháp luật gây tử vong hoặc thương tật thân thể cho Người được bảo hiểm.
#ASSERT `the Part 2 answer for` (`a permanent injury at 35% to` `another person carried` `, circumstances` (LIST `the vehicle used for driving practice`) `, alcohol` FALSE `, licence` `a valid licence for this kind of vehicle`) EQUALS `not covered under Part 2` (LIST `excluded under Part 2 by` `P2 3.7 driving practice or racing`)
#ASSERT `the Part 2 answer for` (`a permanent injury at 35% to` `another person carried` `, circumstances` (LIST `the vehicle used for sport racing or racing, lawful or not`) `, alcohol` FALSE `, licence` `a valid licence for this kind of vehicle`) EQUALS `not covered under Part 2` (LIST `excluded under Part 2 by` `P2 3.7 driving practice or racing`)
#ASSERT `the Part 2 answer for` (`a permanent injury at 35% to` `another person carried` `, circumstances` (LIST `goods carried unlawfully or loading rules broken, causing the death or injury`) `, alcohol` FALSE `, licence` `a valid licence for this kind of vehicle`) EQUALS `not covered under Part 2` (LIST `excluded under Part 2 by` `P2 3.8 unlawful goods or loading causing the harm`)

§§ `Part 2 Article 4 — the benefits`

-- 4.1: death, the whole sum insured. 4.2(a): permanent injury at the table's 35% = 35.000.000.
-- src:582 | 1. Trường hợp Người được bảo hiểm bị chết do tai nạn thuộc phạm vi bảo hiểm: UIC trả toàn bộ số tiền bảo hiểm
